Z||000005||Ozzy||07-07-2000||10:00 PM||||Glad to hear you are doing well Ogre. I have not been online much recently and have been wondering about you.<P>I'm with MM...This too shall pass!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best wishes<P>Ozzy||||reg||1
