Z||000010||Patrick||07-10-2000||02:46 AM||||<BR>I've been out of town just short of two weeks and I had no internet access. (Heck, I had no electricity or phone for that matter.) Glad to hear that you're progressing Ogre. We miss your contributions here at the forum. Eventually all this current nonsense will be but a faint memory, and you'll be back skinning your knuckles along with the rest of us.||||reg||14
Z||000011||Coconut||07-10-2000||07:26 PM||||Good to see ya coming along Ogre!! Glad to hear that the chemo isn't boggin' you down too badly (must not affect you cave dwellers as much, eh?)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Anyway, Keep the faith, Amigo....we're still pullin' for ya! GTGirl says "Hey"! <P>Cruisin' On,<BR>Coconut  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut_2.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by Coconut (edited 07-10-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000012||theogre||07-13-2000||12:00 AM||||Good News!<P>one of the markers used to detect my cancer has gone from over 12000 to 700. How many percent drop is that? <P>and I made it thru the last week (5+ hours every day for 5 days week.) without days of barfing. (this is a one shot week. those don't bother me.)<P>the hair is gone. after about 5 days of the long mess falling out I gave up and buzzed it. I was shedding faster than the dog. it was really bad. I'll likely keep it this short untill it all shows life again then let it grow out. probly be at least another couple months before that happens.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Ozzy||07-13-2000||01:15 AM||||Right on Ogre!<P>Who the hell needs hair anyway??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Keep us updated with any progress. <P>Ozzy||||reg||14
Z||000014||Raydar||07-13-2000||09:34 AM||||Ogre, <BR>The little ol' calculator seems to indicate a 94% drop. Sounds really good!<BR>We're thinkin' about ya' man.<BR>And, as one of our local talk-radio hosts (Neal Boortz) says, "Remember! The less hair ya' got, the more head ya' got!" <BR>Can I say that in a public forum? <BR>Oops. too late.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000015||Sage||07-13-2000||09:45 AM||||Great to hear that news!<P>As for the hair, one of my bald friends has the best response..."Which would ya rather have...hair or brains!?" LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hang in there, glad to know you are coming along, we're all still pulling for ya! <P>Keep the faith.<P>Have a good one!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
