Z||000019||theogre||07-25-2000||06:00 PM||||more news.<BR>the marker we've been watching is now down to 17. This <I>may</I> be my last cycle of chemo. We'll find out about in 2 weeks. Now If we've finnaly gotten the blood clots in my legs to settle out I'm all set. YEAH!<P>------------------<BR>Lake Superior? Is that what I stepped in? Sorry.||||reg||1
