Z||000021||Gokart'sGirl||07-25-2000||09:37 PM||||Hello Ogre, <P>I am Gokart'sGirl. I just wanted to tell you (myself)how happy I am to hear of your great progress with your chemo treatments  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>I have been following this through Gokart who always let me know the latest on your condition.  Please know that you are in our thoughts and prayers. <P>I look forward to each of your posts and hope to see you a bit more once you get back on track.<P>BTW ... Bald men are sexy! Just look at Sean Connery  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Best wishes for a speedy return to your healthy self!<P><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||7
